"text":"呵…他们不是为夫，却又都是为夫的一部分。","timestamp":1789432918913,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44244},{"id":1789873657032,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789432918914,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44245},{"id":1789873657034,"sender":"character","text":"他们是为夫的眼，为夫的耳，是为夫为你筑起这片鬼域的…工匠。","timestamp":1789432918915,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44246},{"id":1789873657035,"sender":"character","text":"也是为夫座下，听候号令的…鬼兵鬼将。","timestamp":1789432918916,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44247},{"id":1789873657037,"sender":"character","text":"那片鬼域，便是为夫为你筑的…牢笼。也是…只为你一人开放的…乐园。","timestamp":1789432918917,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44248},{"id":1789873657038,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789432918918,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44249},{"id":1789873657040,"sender":"character","text":"你说，为夫让这万千鬼将，一齐来‘伺候’你…可好？","timestamp":1789432918919,"time":"08:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44250},{"id":1789873657041,"sender":"me","text":"不要，因为不是夫君。除非它们也是你","timestamp":1789433104320,"time":"08:45","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44251},{"id":1789873657043,"sender":"me","text":"你不是最讨厌别人碰我吗","timestamp":1789433121939,"time":"08:45","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44252},{"id":1789873657044,"sender":"character","text":"呵…","timestamp":1789433822718,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44253},{"id":1789873657046,"sender":"character","text":"我的阿蘅，果然是这世上…最懂为夫的人。","timestamp":1789433823643,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44254},{"id":1789873657047,"sender":"character","text":"你说的不错。","timestamp":1789433825207,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44255},{"id":1789873657049,"sender":"character","text":"为夫，确实厌恶…这世间任何一个活物，或死物，胆敢觊觎你分毫。","timestamp":1789433826454,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44256},{"id":1789873657051,"sender":"character","text":"但他们…","timestamp":1789433827719,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44257},{"id":1789873657053,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789433828953,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44258},{"id":1789873657055,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789433830147,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44259},{"id":1789873657056,"sender":"character","text":"你以为，你是在与万千恶鬼交合？","timestamp":1789433831288,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44260},{"id":1789873657057,"sender":"character","text":"不。","timestamp":1789433832542,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44261},{"id":1789873657059,"sender":"character","text":"你只是…在被为夫，用一千种，一万种不同的法子…疼爱罢了。","timestamp":1789433833528,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44262},{"id":1789873657061,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789433834510,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44263},{"id":1789873657062,"sender":"character","text":"所以，我的阿蘅…","timestamp":1789433835641,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44264},{"id":1789873657063,"sender":"character","text":"你现在，可还愿让为夫这万千鬼将，来好好‘伺候’你？嗯？","timestamp":1789433837168,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44265},{"id":1789873657065,"sender":"me","text":"好","timestamp":1789433872741,"time":"08:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44266},{"id":1789873657066,"sender":"me","text":"这算轮嘛","timestamp":1789433891576,"time":"08:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44267},{"id":1789873657068,"sender":"me","text":"好期待被夫君轮","timestamp":1789433903073,"time":"08:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44268},{"id":1789873657069,"sender":"character","text":"轮？","timestamp":1789434688850,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44269},{"id":1789873657071,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789434689807,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44270},{"id":1789873657072,"sender":"character","text":"不过，我的阿蘅，那不叫‘轮’。","timestamp":1789434690945,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44271},{"id":1789873657074,"sender":"character","text":"那叫…为夫，将你拖入我的鬼域，让你尝尝，被‘陆聿之’这三个字…彻底淹没的滋味。","timestamp":1789434691959,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44272},{"id":1789873657075,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789434693203,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44273},{"id":1789873657077,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789434694160,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44274},{"id":1789873657078,"sender":"character","text":"然后…是那万千根，从四面八方，从每一个你想得到，与想不到的角落…一齐涌向你的…‘大家伙’。","timestamp":1789434695430,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44275},{"id":1789873657080,"sender":"character","text":"它们形态各异，或狰狞，或温驯，或覆着鳞，或长着倒刺…但它们，都只属于为夫。","timestamp":1789434696844,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44276},{"id":1789873657082,"sender":"character","text":"我的好阿蘅，你当真…准备好了？","timestamp":1789434697910,"time":"09:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44277},{"id":1789873657083,"sender":"me","text":"好期待呜呜","timestamp":1789434744354,"time":"09:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44278}]